1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,900
Once upon a time, in a quiet forest, there lived a girl named Wren.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:09,448
Every day, Wren learned one new word, and said it to her friend, the fox.

3
00:00:09,448 --> 00:00:09,806
Brave.

4
00:00:09,806 --> 00:00:10,223
Gentle.

5
00:00:10,223 --> 00:00:10,699
Curious.

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:15,790
By the end of the year, she knew three hundred and sixty five new words.

7
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:18,167
One word a day becomes a whole new language.

8
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:18,599
The end.

